{"v": 1, "key": "cu-cu17", "cards": [{"id": "u1.t.multicellular", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">mul<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ti<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">CEL<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">lu<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">lar<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"multicellular\" data-audio=\"audio/multicellular.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: multicellular\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"multicellular\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"36\" r=\"14\" class=\"f1\"/><circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"36\" r=\"14\" class=\"f2\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"36\" r=\"14\" class=\"f3\"/><circle cx=\"75\" cy=\"62\" r=\"14\" class=\"f4\"/><circle cx=\"105\" cy=\"62\" r=\"14\" class=\"f5\"/><circle cx=\"135\" cy=\"62\" r=\"14\" class=\"f6\"/><circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"88\" r=\"14\" class=\"f1\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"88\" r=\"14\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">many cells = one body<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Made of many cells that work together.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>多细胞的<\/b>：由许多相互协作的细胞构成。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">multi- = many.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">multi- = 许多。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Name a multicellular organism.<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Any plant, animal or mushroom (for example, a tree).<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.tissue", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">TIS<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">sue<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"tissue\" data-audio=\"audio/tissue.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: tissue\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"tissue\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"40\" y=\"18\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f2\"/><rect x=\"70\" y=\"18\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f2\"/><rect x=\"100\" y=\"18\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f2\"/><rect x=\"130\" y=\"18\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f2\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"38\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f2\"/><rect x=\"70\" y=\"38\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f2\"/><rect x=\"100\" y=\"38\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f2\"/><rect x=\"130\" y=\"38\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"85\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">muscle tissue<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">similar cells + same job<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A group of similar cells that do the same job.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>组织<\/b>：一群形态相似、执行同一功能的细胞。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A tissue is a team of the same kind of cell.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">组织 = 同一种细胞组成的小队。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What do we call a group of similar cells doing one job?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">A tissue.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.organ", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">OR<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">gan<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"organ\" data-audio=\"audio/organ.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: organ\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"organ\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"86\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"49\" y=\"52.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Muscle + nerve<\/text><text x=\"49\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">+ blood<\/text><text x=\"49\" y=\"74.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">tissues<\/text><line x1=\"93.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"107.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"107.0,60.0 102.5,62.2 102.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"108\" y=\"34\" width=\"86\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"151\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Heart (an<\/text><text x=\"151\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">organ)<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A body part made of several tissues that works as one unit for a job.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>器官<\/b>：由几种组织构成、共同完成某项任务的身体部分。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">An organ is a tool made of several tissues.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">器官 = 由几种组织组成的「工具」。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Is the heart a tissue or an organ?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">An organ. It is made of several tissues.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.organ-system", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">OR<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">gan<\/span> <span class=\"st\">SYS<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tem<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"organ system\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: organ system\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"organ system\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"86\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"49\" y=\"52.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Mouth +<\/text><text x=\"49\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">stomach +<\/text><text x=\"49\" y=\"74.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">intestine<\/text><line x1=\"93.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"107.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"107.0,60.0 102.5,62.2 102.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"108\" y=\"34\" width=\"86\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"151\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Digestive<\/text><text x=\"151\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">system<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Several organs that work together to do a big job for the body.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>器官系统<\/b>：几个器官协同完成身体的某项大功能。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">System = organs on one team.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">系统 = 同一支队伍里的几个器官。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Name the system that includes the stomach and intestines.<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">The digestive system.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.levels-of-organization", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term sm\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">LEV<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">els<\/span> <span class=\"sy\">of<\/span> <span class=\"sy\">or<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">gan<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">i<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">ZA<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tion<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"levels of organization\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: levels of organization\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"levels of organization\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"12\" width=\"54.6667\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"33.3333\" y=\"31.8\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Cell<\/text><rect x=\"72.6667\" y=\"12\" width=\"54.6667\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"31.8\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Tissue<\/text><rect x=\"139.333\" y=\"12\" width=\"54.6667\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"166.667\" y=\"31.8\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Organ<\/text><rect x=\"139.333\" y=\"72\" width=\"54.6667\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f4\"/><text x=\"166.667\" y=\"87.2\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Organ<\/text><text x=\"166.667\" y=\"96.4\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">system<\/text><rect x=\"72.6667\" y=\"72\" width=\"54.6667\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f5\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"91.8\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Organism<\/text><line x1=\"61.666666666666664\" y1=\"29.0\" x2=\"71.66666666666666\" y2=\"29.0\"/><polygon points=\"71.66666666666666,29.0 67.2,31.2 67.2,26.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><line x1=\"128.33333333333331\" y1=\"29.0\" x2=\"138.33333333333331\" y2=\"29.0\"/><polygon points=\"138.33333333333331,29.0 133.8,31.2 133.8,26.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><line x1=\"166.66666666666666\" y1=\"47\" x2=\"166.66666666666666\" y2=\"71\"/><polygon points=\"166.66666666666666,71 164.5,66.5 168.8,66.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><line x1=\"138.33333333333331\" y1=\"89.0\" x2=\"128.33333333333331\" y2=\"89.0\"/><polygon points=\"128.33333333333331,89.0 132.8,86.8 132.8,91.2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">The steps from small to large: cell, tissue, organ, organ system, organism.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>组织层次<\/b>：从小到大的层级：细胞、组织、器官、器官系统、个体。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Say it in order: Cats Take Over Our Offices = cell, tissue, organ, organ system, organism.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">顺口溜：细胞→组织→器官→系统→个体。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Which is bigger: a tissue or an organ?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">An organ.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.population", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">pop<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">u<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">LA<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tion<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"population\" data-audio=\"audio/population.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: population\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"population\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"85\" ry=\"48\" class=\"f3 d\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"50\" r=\"7\" class=\"f1\"/><circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"42\" r=\"7\" class=\"f1\"/><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"55\" r=\"7\" class=\"f1\"/><circle cx=\"75\" cy=\"82\" r=\"7\" class=\"f1\"/><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"85\" r=\"7\" class=\"f1\"/><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"75\" r=\"7\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"114\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">one species, one place<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">All the members of one species living in the same area.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>种群<\/b>：同一地区内同一物种的全部个体。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Population = the &quot;people&quot; of one species.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">population = 同一物种的「居民」。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: All the deer in one forest are what level?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">A population.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.community", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">com<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">MU<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ni<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ty<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"community\" data-audio=\"audio/community.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: community\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"community\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"85\" ry=\"48\" class=\"f3 d\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"50\" r=\"7\" class=\"f1\"/><rect x=\"85\" y=\"38\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f2\"/><path d=\"M120 55 L130 75 L110 75 Z\" class=\"f4\"/><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"85\" r=\"7\" class=\"f5\"/><rect x=\"115\" y=\"90\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f6\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"114\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">many species, one place<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">All the different populations that live together in one area.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>群落<\/b>：同一地区内所有不同物种的种群的总和。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Community = many species living as neighbours.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">community = 不同物种的「邻居们」。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Is a community made of one species or many?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Many species.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.ecosystem", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">E<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">co<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">sys<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tem<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"ecosystem\" data-audio=\"audio/ecosystem.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: ecosystem\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"ecosystem\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"22\" width=\"90\" height=\"76\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"51\" y=\"42\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Community<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">all the living<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">things in an area<\/text><rect x=\"104\" y=\"22\" width=\"90\" height=\"76\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"149\" y=\"42\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Ecosystem<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">community + soil,<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">water, air,<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">sunlight<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A community plus the non-living things around it, such as water, soil and sunlight.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>生态系统<\/b>：群落加上周围的非生物环境，如水、土壤和阳光。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">eco- = home. An ecosystem is a home with living and non-living parts.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">eco- = 家园；生态系统 = 有生命与无生命部分的家。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What does an ecosystem include that a community does not?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Non-living (abiotic) factors such as water, soil and sunlight.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.taxonomy", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">tax<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">ON<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">o<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">my<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"taxonomy\" data-audio=\"audio/taxonomy.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: taxonomy\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"taxonomy\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"3\" width=\"190\" height=\"12.75\" rx=\"3\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"13.125\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Domain<\/text><rect x=\"12.8571\" y=\"17.25\" width=\"174.286\" height=\"12.75\" rx=\"3\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"27.375\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Kingdom<\/text><rect x=\"20.7143\" y=\"31.5\" width=\"158.571\" height=\"12.75\" rx=\"3\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"41.625\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Phylum<\/text><rect x=\"28.5714\" y=\"45.75\" width=\"142.857\" height=\"12.75\" rx=\"3\" class=\"f4\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"55.875\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Class<\/text><rect x=\"36.4286\" y=\"60\" width=\"127.143\" height=\"12.75\" rx=\"3\" class=\"f5\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"70.125\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Order<\/text><rect x=\"44.2857\" y=\"74.25\" width=\"111.429\" height=\"12.75\" rx=\"3\" class=\"f6\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"84.375\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Family<\/text><rect x=\"52.1429\" y=\"88.5\" width=\"95.7143\" height=\"12.75\" rx=\"3\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"98.625\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Genus<\/text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"102.75\" width=\"80\" height=\"12.75\" rx=\"3\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"112.875\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Species<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">The science of naming, describing and grouping living things.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>分类学<\/b>：为生物命名、描述并归类的科学。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">taxis = arrange, nomos = law. The rules for arranging life.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">taxis = 排列，nomos = 规则：排列生物的规则。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What does taxonomy do?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">It names and groups living things.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}], "quiz": [{"id": "cu.q.u1.t.multicellular", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Made of many cells that work together.”<\/i>", "opts": ["kingdom", "multicellular", "growth and development", "six-kingdom system"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>multicellular<\/b>: Made of many cells that work together. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">多细胞的<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.tissue", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A group of similar cells that do the same job.”<\/i>", "opts": ["organ system", "tissue", "Eukarya", "family"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>tissue<\/b>: A group of similar cells that do the same job. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">组织<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.organ", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A body part made of several tissues that works as one unit for a job.”<\/i>", "opts": ["organ", "organism", "phylogeny", "cladogram"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>organ<\/b>: A body part made of several tissues that works as one unit for a job. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">器官<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.organ-system", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Several organs that work together to do a big job for the body.”<\/i>", "opts": ["domain", "organ system", "reproduction", "derived characteristic"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>organ system<\/b>: Several organs that work together to do a big job for the body. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">器官系统<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.levels-of-organization", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“The steps from small to large: cell, tissue, organ, organ system, organism.”<\/i>", "opts": ["levels of organization", "dichotomous key", "phylum", "phylogeny"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>levels of organization<\/b>: The steps from small to large: cell, tissue, organ, organ system, organism. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">组织层次<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.population", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“All the members of one species living in the same area.”<\/i>", "opts": ["Eukarya", "three-domain system", "population", "levels of organization"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>population<\/b>: All the members of one species living in the same area. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">种群<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.community", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“All the different populations that live together in one area.”<\/i>", "opts": ["community", "six-kingdom system", "response", "organ"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>community<\/b>: All the different populations that live together in one area. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">群落<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.ecosystem", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A community plus the non-living things around it, such as water, soil and sunlight.”<\/i>", "opts": ["ecosystem", "domain", "binomial nomenclature", "six-kingdom system"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>ecosystem<\/b>: A community plus the non-living things around it, such as water, soil and sunlight. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">生态系统<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.taxonomy", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“The science of naming, describing and grouping living things.”<\/i>", "opts": ["taxonomy", "multicellular", "ecosystem", "community"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>taxonomy<\/b>: The science of naming, describing and grouping living things. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">分类学<\/span>", "whys": null}]}